    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naamani kūpījiwa mbiji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho munhū, lina lyakwe Naamani; walī ntaale wa mabità ga ntemi wa Alamu. Nīyo ū munhū ng'wenūyo ū mu miso ga ng'wa ise būgonzo walī nkūjiwa no, hangī walī asanyiwe no no no, nguno ū SEEBA wabinhaga būtindi būtaale a Baalamu kūlwa būtūmami bokwe ū munhū ng'wenūyo. Ū wei walī ngosha wa mbagashūla, gwike dūhū walī asaatile mbiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makanza malebe a Baalamu aho babadima Baisilaeli, būnjana ng'wanikī ūmò, ūūkabiza ngunanhi wa nke o ng'wa Naamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò ū ng'wanikī ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla ū nina būgonzo, “Alīko ng'hangi Samalia, ū baba būgonzo ūlū ni wamona ū munhū ng'wenūyo ni wampīja ū būsaatū wakwe ū wa mbiji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Naamani ūja ū kūlī ise būgonzo ūūkahaya, “Alīho ng'wanikī wafumile Isilaeli, alīhaya gīkī na gīkī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Alamu ūhaya, “Jaga koi, nīyo nakūtūma na nyalūba ū kūlī ntemi wa Isilaeli.” Na lūūlū ū Naamani ūbūūka, ūsola na mheela, kilo magana adatū na makūmi anè ja feza, na kilo makūmi mpungatī ja zahabu, na shizwalo ikūmi sha kwalūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nyalūba īyo akījana ū kūlī ntemi wa Isilaeli yalī īhayile, “Ī nyalūba yenīyī nalīkūtūmīla kūlwa kūkūmanīkīja gīkī nakwenhela koi ū ntūmami wane ū Naamani wize ūmpīje; nguno alī na būsaatu wa mbiji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli aho wīsoma ī nyalūba yenīyo, ūtandūla ī shizwalo shakwe; ūhaya, “Ū nene nabizaga nalī Mulungu? Nadūgije kūbūlaga na kūjūūcha? Mhayo kī ūyo gwang'wenheleja ū munhū ng'wenūyū kūnenhela nsaatū wa mbiji ū nene gīkī nize nampīje? Deebagi gīkī ū ng'wenūyū alīnikoloosha ī haha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Elisha ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu, aho wigwa gīkī ū ntemi wa Isilaeli watandūlaga shizwalo shakwe, ūntūmīla nhūng'wa alīhaya, “Nibūlī watandūla shizwalo shako? Ni izage kūlī nene ū munhū ng'wenūyo, h'akūdeeba gīkī alīmo ng'hangi ū mu Isilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Naamani ūja nī falasa jakwe, na a magogoteni gakwe; ūshika wīmīīla a ha nyango gwa numba ya ng'wa Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūtūma munhū kūng'wīla, “Jaga kū mongo gwa Yolodani ūkizubīke moi ng'hangala mpungatī ūkwela lībeele ī likoba lyako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Naamani ūsaaya no, ūgalūka gīkī ashoke kūja kaya; ūhaya, “Ū nene naaliganikaga gīkī akūfuma iize aha, īmīīle aliitane nī lina lya ng'wa SEEBA ū Mulungu wakwe, ahūnje hūnje na makono gakwe a ha mabala anipīje ī mbiji! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mamyongo ga Damasiko gītī lī Alibana na Līpalīpalī, tūhaya masoga kūbaheeba kūle pye a bana minzī ba mu Isilaeli! Nalī natadūgije koogela kwenūko dūhū neela?” Ūgalūka wapelanaga kīngī nasho, wandya kūja! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a basese bakwe būng'wegeela būng'wīla, “Baba; ī gīsī ū ng'hangi ūlū ni wakūwīlaga kwīta mhayo ntaale ni ūtagwītile? Tūhaya ī haha alīkūwīla dūhū gīkī, ‘Ogaga wele!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna wingīla ng'hana ū mu mongo gwa Yolodani; wizubīka moi ng'hangala mpungatī, gīt'ūmo walī wang'wīlīla ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu. Ū mīlī gwakwe gwejiwa, ī likoba lyakwe lyūbiza gītī lya nyanda ndo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha kūlema kwanukūla inong'ho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Naamani na a banhū bakwe pye a bose būja ū kūlī munhū o ng'wa Mulungu, ūshika wīmīīla ū kū būtongi wakwe ūhaya, “Ī haha nadeeba lūūlū gīkī atīho Mulungu hose hose ū mu sī ūlū ītī mu sī ya Isilaeli dūhū. Nalīkwikūmbīlīja wanukūle līīlī inong'ho kūfuma ū kūlī ntūmami wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'hangi ūhaya, “Ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga ūyo nalī ntūmami wakwe, natanukūlaga shose shose.” Ū Naamani akang'wikūmbīlī no, alīyo ūlema nye gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū Naamani ūhaya, “Naheene lūūlū īkī ūlīlema ū bebe, ū nene ntūmami wako nalīlomba nazunīlījiwe kūbūūcha maseni, ga būdito bo kūdūla kūbūūchiwa na nzobe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "nzobe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ī lina lya ndimu ījo jilīhayiwa ū mu Shiswahili jikitanagwa nyumbu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ibīlī. Nguno ū ntūmami wako atalafunya hangī shakwinha nūūlū shitambò kūlī mulungu ose ose ūngī, ūlū atī SEEBA wike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike gūlīho mhayo gūmò Ū SEEBA ni anekejage ū ntūmami wako; gīkī, ū baba būgonzo ūlū wingīla mu hekalu ya ng'wa Limoni kūlamya, alīyo nū nene nūbiza nalī hamò nang'hwe, hūna nū nene ninama hamò nang'hwe; ūlū ninama ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa Limoni kūlwa nguno ya shilagīlo, nalīlomba ū SEEBA anilekeje ū nene ntūmami wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūng'wīla, “Jaga mu mhola!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gehazi kwikūmvwa manong'ho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Naamani aho waja kabbala ho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū Gehazi ū ntūmami o ng'wa Elisha ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu wiwīla, “Yūū nang'hwe ū baba būgonzo wambūpīja no ū Naamani ū muna Alamu ng'wenūyū; īkī walema nūūlū kūsola shose shose ū mu manong'ho ayo walī wenhaga! Ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga, ū nene nampeeleele aje akaninhe nūūlū tū nani nani!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Gehazi ūng'wihuutīīla ū Naamani, ū Naamani aho wanoleela alīmpeeleela, wika ū ng'wigogoteni lyakwe, ūnsūng'wanha. Ūbūūja, “Kinehe mhola koi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Mm, mhola. Gwike dūhū ū baba būgonzo wanitūma alīhaya gīkī, ‘Basūmba babīlī, bamò ba bahangi banigeniha ī haha yenīyī kūfuma kū sī ja magūlya ga Efulaimu. Na lūūlū nalīlomba ūbinhe kilo makūmi adatū n'inè ja feza, na shizwalo shibīlī gīko.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Naamani ūhaya, “Solaga ng'hangal'ibīlī ya feza jenījo, anukūlaga kilo makūmi atandatū na'inaane ja feza.” Ūndaayīīla ajisole, ūntungīlīja ī feza jenījo, nī shizwalo ī shibīlī. Ūbinha batūmami bakwe babīlī būmūkīja ū Gehazi, ūbatongeja ajile nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gehazi aho washika ū kū lūgūlū ūshisola ī shikolo shenīsho ū kūfuma ū kū batūmami benabo, ūshitūūla mu numba; hūna ūbalaga a banhū benabo, būja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
