        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ūja ū kūlī ise būgonzo ū Elisha kūjūntūmamīla. Ū Elisha ūmūja, “Walī wajaga halī Gehazi?” Ū Gehazi ūshosha ūhaya, “Ū ntūmami wako atajile hose hose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
